              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Leslie Hickman"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is really close to what my family has always used, we just didn't use any sugar and added a dash of Tabasco sauce. It really refrigerates great and can be stored there for up to a year! We use it on EVERYTHING we grill! We just heat it up after coming out of the refrigerator!"
